ar</surname><given-names>D.G.</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>J.M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Shore</surname><given-names>G.C.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A signal-anchor sequence selective for the mitochondrial outer membrane</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol.</source><volume>119</volume><year>1992</year><fpage>1451</fpage><lpage>1457</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1334957</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Neupert1997"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Neupert</surname><given-names>W.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Protein import into mitochondria</article-title><source>Annu. Rev. Biochem.</source><volume>66</volume><year>1997</year><fpage>863</fpage><lpage>917</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9242927</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Pfanneretal1992"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pfanner</surname><given-names>N.</given-names></name><name><surname>Rassow</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>van der Klei</surname><given-names>I.</given-names></name><name><surname>Neupert</surname><given-names>W.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A dynamic model of the mitochondrial protein import machinery</article-title><source>Cell.</source><volume>68</volume><year>1992</year><fpage>999</fpage><lpage>1002</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1547510</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Ramageetal1993"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ramage</surname><given-names>L.</given-names></name><name><surname>Junne</surname><given-names>T.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hahne</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Lithgow</surname><given-names>T.</given-names></name><name><surname>Schatz</surname><given-names>G.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Functional cooperatio